[h2]0.10.3 — Reactor Bot faction-validation hotfix[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixed startup crashes when Reactor Bot validation ran for factions other than Iron Teeth, reporting that ReactorCharge was not a Bot need of the current faction.
[*]Reactor Bot need and coolant validation now runs only for Iron Teeth. Other factions do not need to declare those Iron Teeth-only needs.
[*]Iron Teeth validation remains enabled. This hotfix does not change Reactor Bot balance or add Reactor Bots to other factions.
[/list]
